[Unit]
Description=Nightly ClamAV scan of new files
Documentation=file:///home/buntu/Projects/Docker/Antivirus/README.md

[Timer]
# Inside the maintenance window: fastpi wakes beefy at 03:55 and it powers off about 04:25 when idle. A night asleep is skipped; the marker stays, so the next run catches up.
OnCalendar=*-*-* 04:05

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
